        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+1 warhammer</em> has three stylized chimera carved into its gold-plated head: a scowling horned dragon, a snorting goat with mighty horns, and a fearsome great cat with its jaws open in a terrifying scream. By activating Chimera's Visage, you can select which of its three heads functions as its primary head, which in turn determines the weapon's capabilities.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Chimera's Visage</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate) You shift Chimera's Claw to change its primary head, allowing access to that head's weapon traits and secondary effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Horned Dragon Head</strong> The dragon head's horn deals piercing damage. In this mode, the warhammer has the sweep and versatile S weapon traits. Each time you damage a creature with this weapon, the dragon's flaring nostrils snort out a small cloud of cloying, acrid gas that deals an additional 2 persistent poison damage in addition to the weapon's normal damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Screaming Cat Head</strong> The screaming cat's brutal teeth deal slashing damage. In this mode, the warhammer has the backstabber and versatile B weapon traits. Tiny rubies inset into the eyes of the weapon's screaming cat face ignite as bright-red pinpoints, distracting foes with traces of crimson light as the weapon shifts and moves in combat. This grants you a +2 item bonus to [[/act feint]] against a target you damaged with Chimera's Claw in the previous round.</p>\n<p><strong>Snorting Goat Head</strong> The snorting goat's curled horns and heavy brow deal bludgeoning damage. In this mode, the warhammer has the shove and versatile P weapon traits. The goat head's long horns function as a levered crowbar.</p>"
        },
